        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86061, Sandcast Bronze Twig Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Twig Cabinet Pull is perfect for your mountain cabin retreat. Its natural appeal makes it a winner for any country or rustic modern home. The Sandcast Bronze Twig Cabinet Pull is available in medium bronze, flat black bronze, and white bronze finishes. Choose from 4 sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/8-inch-rustic-twig-cabin-door-handle-emtek-86090\"><b>8 Inch Rustic Twig Cabin Door Handle</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Twig Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86061-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Twig Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86061:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86062:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-86063:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86252:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
